st", "explanation": "把废材料做成新东西，就是变废为宝。"}, {"id": "high-interest-111", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "合唱时大家应该怎样？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "声音整齐、互相配合"}, {"id": "b", "text": "比谁唱得最大声"}, {"id": "c", "text": "各唱各的"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "合唱讲究和谐，不是比嗓门。"}, {"id": "high-interest-112", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "素描通常先用什么打底？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "铅笔"}, {"id": "b", "text": "毛笔"}, {"id": "c", "text": "蜡笔"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "素描多用铅笔，方便擦改和分明暗。"}, {"id": "high-interest-113", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "下面哪个是吹奏乐器？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "长笛"}, {"id": "b", "text": "架子鼓"}, {"id": "c", "text": "吉他"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "长笛靠吹气发声，是吹奏乐器。"}, {"id": "high-interest-114", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "想让画面有立体感，可以怎么做？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "画出明暗和阴影"}, {"id": "b", "text": "全涂一个颜色"}, {"id": "c", "text": "只画轮廓"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "有了明暗阴影，平面就显得鼓起来。"}, {"id": "high-interest-115", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“五线谱”上记录的主要是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "音的高低和长短"}, {"id": "b", "text": "歌手长相"}, {"id": "c", "text": "演出时间"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "五线谱用音符记下音的高低和长短。"}, {"id": "high-interest-116", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "做陶艺时湿黏土最后要怎么变硬？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "晾干并烧制"}, {"id": "b", "text": "放冰箱冻"}, {"id": "c", "text": "泡水里"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "陶土要晾干再高温烧制才结实。"}, {"id": "high-interest-117", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "学一样乐器最关键的是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "坚持练习"}, {"id": "b", "text": "买最贵的"}, {"id": "c", "text": "天天换乐器"}], "subject": "interest", "explanation": "再好的乐器也要靠常练才能进步。"}, {"id": "low-funny-101", "band": "low", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么东西越洗越脏？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "水"}, {"id": "b", "text": "毛巾"}, {"id": "c", "text": "衣服"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "你洗东西，水就越来越脏啦。"}, {"id": "low-funny-102", 