", "text": "杯子"}, {"id": "c", "text": "气球"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "破了纪录是好事，大家都鼓掌。"}, {"id": "high-funny-111", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么东西你有别人也有，但你不能给别人？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "名字（你叫的那个）"}, {"id": "b", "text": "玩具"}, {"id": "c", "text": "零食"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "名字大家都有，但谁也送不出去。"}, {"id": "high-funny-112", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么东西天气越热它越往上爬？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "温度计的水银柱"}, {"id": "b", "text": "蚂蚁"}, {"id": "c", "text": "气球"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "越热温度计的柱子升得越高。"}, {"id": "high-funny-113", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么屋子最小？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "委屈（委“屈”）"}, {"id": "b", "text": "鸽子屋"}, {"id": "c", "text": "帐篷"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "谐音梗：心里“憋屈”的那间屋最小。"}, {"id": "high-funny-114", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么东西看不见、摸不着，但一开口它就跑了？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "秘密"}, {"id": "b", "text": "空气"}, {"id": "c", "text": "风"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "秘密一说出口就守不住了。"}, {"id": "high-funny-115", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "明明是冬天，为什么有人还在“出汗”？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "他在运动"}, {"id": "b", "text": "因为很冷"}, {"id": "c", "text": "因为下雪"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "运动起来全身发热，冬天也照样出汗。"}, {"id": "high-funny-116", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么东西只能往里装，倒不出来？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "脑子里的知识"}, {"id": "b", "text": "水杯里的水"}, {"id": "c", "text": "口袋里的糖"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "学进脑子里的知识，可倒不出来送人。"}, {"id": "high-funny-117", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "什么东西用得越多，剩得越少，却谁也舍不得停？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "时间（在做喜欢的事时）"}, {"id": "b", "text": "铅笔"}, {"id": "c", "text": "橡皮"}], "subject": "funny", "explanation": "做喜欢的事时间嗖嗖过，可谁也不想停。"}, {"id": "lo-math-201", "band": "low", "answer": "a", "prompt": "4 加 4 等于几？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "8"}, {"id": "b", "text": "7"}, {"id": "c", "text": "9"}, {"id": "d", "text": "6"}], "subject": 