2", "band": "low", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“认真”的反义词是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "聪明"}, {"id": "b", "text": "马虎"}, {"id": "c", "text": "高兴"}, {"id": "d", "text": "努力"}], "subject": "chinese"}, {"id": "lo-chinese-223", "band": "low", "answer": "c", "prompt": "古诗“锄禾日当午”的下一句是？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "春眠不觉晓"}, {"id": "b", "text": "粒粒皆辛苦"}, {"id": "c", "text": "汗滴禾下土"}, {"id": "d", "text": "疑是地上霜"}], "subject": "chinese"}, {"id": "lo-chinese-224", "band": "low", "answer": "b", "prompt": "下面哪个字是“鸟”字旁，和鸟有关？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "河"}, {"id": "b", "text": "鸡"}, {"id": "c", "text": "花"}, {"id": "d", "text": "草"}], "subject": "chinese"}, {"id": "hi-math-1", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一个数的 3/5 是 36，这个数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "60"}, {"id": "b", "text": "21.6"}, {"id": "c", "text": "54"}, {"id": "d", "text": "90"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "36 ÷ 3/5 = 36 × 5/3 = 60。"}, {"id": "hi-math-2", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "甲数是乙数的 4 倍，两数相差 27，乙数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "6.75"}, {"id": "b", "text": "9"}, {"id": "c", "text": "36"}, {"id": "d", "text": "108"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "相差 4-1=3 份，27÷3=9 是乙数。"}, {"id": "hi-math-3", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "把 0.375 化成最简分数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "37/100"}, {"id": "b", "text": "5/8"}, {"id": "c", "text": "3/8"}, {"id": "d", "text": "3/4"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "0.375 = 375/1000 = 3/8。"}, {"id": "hi-math-4", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "一个圆的半径是 4 厘米，它的面积约是多少？(π取3.14)", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "25.12 平方厘米"}, {"id": "b", "text": "12.56 平方厘米"}, {"id": "c", "text": "16 平方厘米"}, {"id": "d", "text": "50.24 平方厘米"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "面积=πr²=3.14×4×4=50.24。"}, {"id": "hi-math-5", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一个圆的直径是 10 厘米，周长约是多少？(π取3.14)", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "31.4 厘米"}, {"id": "b", "text": "15.7 厘米"}, {"id": "c", "text": "78.5 厘米"}, {"id": "d", "text": "62.8 厘米"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "周长=πd=3.14×10=31.4。"}, {"id": "hi-math-6", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "某商品先涨价 10%，再降价 10%，现价和原价比怎样？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "正好相等"}, {"id": "b", "text": "比原价低"}, {"id": "c", "text": "比原价高"}, {"id": "d", "text": "无法确定"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "1×1.1×0.9=0.99，比原价低 1%。"}, {"id": "hi-math-7", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "5/6 与 7/9 通分后比较，哪个大？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "7/9 大"}, {"id": "b", "text": "一样大"}, {"id": "c", "text": "5/6 大"}, {"id": "d", "text": "没法比"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "通分：5/6=15/18，7/9=14/18，所以 5/6 大。"}, {"id": "hi-math-8", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "甲乙两数的比是 3:5，和是 64，甲是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "40"}, {"id": "b", "text": "32"}, {"id": "c", "text": "21"}, {"id": "d", "text": "24"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "共 8 份，64÷8=8，甲 3 份=24。"}, {"id": "hi-math-9", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一项工程甲单独做 10 天完成，甲一天完成全部的几分之几？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "1/10"}, {"id": "b", "text": "10"}, {"id": "c", "text": "1/5"}, {"id": "d", "text": "10%还差一点"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "把工程看作 1，一天做 1÷10=1/10。"}, {"id": "hi-math-10", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "一杯盐水共 200 克，含盐 16 克，盐水的含盐率是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "16%"}, {"id": "b", "text": "8%"}, {"id": "c", "text": "12.5%"}, {"id": "d", "text": "4%"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "16÷200=0.08=8%。"}, {"id": "hi-math-11", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "一个长方体长 5、宽 4、高 3，体积是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "12"}, {"id": "b", "text": "47"}, {"id": "c", "text": "60"}, {"id": "d", "text": "94"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "体积=长×宽×高=5×4×3=60。"}, {"id": "hi-math-12", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "上题那个长 5、宽 4、高 3 的长方体，表面积是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "60"}, {"id": "b", "text": "47"}, {"id": "c", "text": "120"}, {"id": "d", "text": "94"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "表面积=2×(5×4+5×3+4×3)=2×47=94。"}, {"id": "hi-math-13", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "找规律：2、6、12、20、30、后面一个数是几？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "42"}, {"id": "b", "text": "36"}, {"id": "c", "text": "40"}, {"id": "d", "text": "48"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "差是 4、6、8、10、12，30+12=42。"}, {"id": "hi-math-14", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "一个三角形的底是 8、高是 5，面积是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "40"}, {"id": "b", "text": "20"}, {"id": "c", "text": "13"}, {"id": "d", "text": "26"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "三角形面积=底×高÷2=8×5÷2=20。"}, {"id": "hi-math-15", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "一个梯形上底 4、下底 6、高 5，面积是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "30"}, {"id": "b", "text": "50"}, {"id": "c", "text": "25"}, {"id": "d", "text": "15"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "梯形面积=(上底+下底)×高÷2=(4+6)×5÷2=25。"}, {"id": "hi-math-16", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "把一个比例式 4:x = 6:9 解出来，x 是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "13.5"}, {"id": "b", "text": "5"}, {"id": "c", "text": "7"}, {"id": "d", "text": "6"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "4×9=6×x，36=6x，x=6。"}, {"id": "hi-math-17", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一辆车 3 小时行 180 千米，照这个速度 5 小时行多少千米？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "300"}, {"id": "b", "text": "240"}, {"id": "c", "text": "360"}, {"id": "d", "text": "108"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "速度 180÷3=60，60×5=300。"}, {"id": "hi-math-18", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "把 7/8 减去 3/4，结果是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "4/4"}, {"id": "b", "text": "1/8"}, {"id": "c", "text": "1/2"}, {"id": "d", "text": "4/8"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "3/4=6/8，7/8-6/8=1/8。"}, {"id": "hi-math-19", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "一个数减去它的 1/4 后是 60，这个数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "75"}, {"id": "b", "text": "45"}, {"id": "c", "text": "80"}, {"id": "d", "text": "64"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "剩 3/4，60÷3/4=80。"}, {"id": "hi-math-20", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "六年级有学生 240 人，男生占 5/8，女生有多少人？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "150"}, {"id": "b", "text": "120"}, {"id": "c", "text": "96"}, {"id": "d", "text": "90"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "女生占 3/8，240×3/8=90。"}, {"id": "hi-math-21", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一项工作甲 6 小时做完，乙 12 小时做完，两人合做几小时做完？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "4 小时"}, {"id": "b", "text": "9 小时"}, {"id": "c", "text": "18 小时"}, {"id": "d", "text": "3 小时"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "合做效率 1/6+1/12=1/4，1÷1/4=4 小时。"}, {"id": "hi-math-22", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "一个圆柱底面半径 2、高 5，体积约是多少？(π取3.14)", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "31.4"}, {"id": "b", "text": "62.8"}, {"id": "c", "text": "20"}, {"id": "d", "text": "125.6"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "圆柱体积=πr²h=3.14×4×5=62.8。"}, {"id": "hi-math-23", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "甲数比乙数多 25%，那么乙数比甲数少几分之几？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "1/4"}, {"id": "b", "text": "25%"}, {"id": "c", "text": "1/5"}, {"id": "d", "text": "1/3"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "设乙=4，甲=5，乙比甲少 1/5。"}, {"id": "hi-math-24", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "一根钢管锯成 5 段，要锯几次？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "5 次"}, {"id": "b", "text": "6 次"}, {"id": "c", "text": "3 次"}, {"id": "d", "text": "4 次"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "锯成 5 段只需锯 4 次（段数比次数多 1）。"}, {"id": "hi-math-25", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "钟面上 3 点整，时针和分针的夹角是多少度？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "90 度"}, {"id": "b", "text": "60 度"}, {"id": "c", "text": "120 度"}, {"id": "d", "text": "30 度"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "每格 30 度，3 点时相差 3 格=90 度。"}, {"id": "hi-math-26", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "一件商品打七五折出售是 90 元，原价是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "67.5 元"}, {"id": "b", "text": "120 元"}, {"id": "c", "text": "115 元"}, {"id": "d", "text": "135 元"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "90÷0.75=120。"}, {"id": "hi-math-27", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "把 36 分解质因数，正确的是哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "2×2×9"}, {"id": "b", "text": "4×9"}, {"id": "c", "text": "2×2×3×3"}, {"id": "d", "text": "6×6"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "分解质因数要全是质数：36=2×2×3×3。"}, {"id": "hi-math-28", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "12 和 18 的最大公因数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "36"}, {"id": "b", "text": "3"}, {"id": "c", "text": "2"}, {"id": "d", "text": "6"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "12 因数有1236..，18 有 6，最大公因数 6。"}, {"id": "hi-math-29", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "4 和 6 的最小公倍数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "12"}, {"id": "b", "text": "24"}, {"id": "c", "text": "2"}, {"id": "d", "text": "10"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "4 的倍数 4,8,12…6 的倍数 6,12…最小是 12。"}, {"id": "hi-math-30", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "一个数的 20% 是 14，这个数的 50% 是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "70"}, {"id": "b", "text": "35"}, {"id": "c", "text": "28"}, {"id": "d", "text": "7"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "这个数=14÷0.2=70，70×50%=35。"}, {"id": "hi-math-31", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "甲走完全程要 60 分钟，乙要 40 分钟，乙的速度是甲的几倍？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "2/3 倍"}, {"id": "b", "text": "1.2 倍"}, {"id": "c", "text": "1.5 倍"}, {"id": "d", "text": "相等"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "路程相同，时间比 60:40=3:2，速度比 2:3 反过来，乙是甲的 3/2=1.5 倍。"}, {"id": "hi-math-32", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "找规律：1、4、9、16、25、后面一个数是几？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "30"}, {"id": "b", "text": "49"}, {"id": "c", "text": "32"}, {"id": "d", "text": "36"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "都是平方数：1²2²3²4²5²，下一个 6²=36。"}, {"id": "hi-math-33", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一个比的前项是 12，比值是 3/4，后项是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "16"}, {"id": "b", "text": "9"}, {"id": "c", "text": "48"}, {"id": "d", "text": "4"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "12÷后项=3/4，后项=12÷3/4=16。"}, {"id": "hi-math-34", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "把一个长方形的长扩大 2 倍、宽不变，面积变成原来的几倍？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "4 倍"}, {"id": "b", "text": "2 倍"}, {"id": "c", "text": "不变"}, {"id": "d", "text": "3 倍"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "面积=长×宽，长翻倍则面积翻倍。"}, {"id": "hi-math-35", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "商店运来苹果和梨共 60 筐，苹果是梨的 2 倍，梨有多少筐？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "40"}, {"id": "b", "text": "30"}, {"id": "c", "text": "20"}, {"id": "d", "text": "15"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "共 3 份，60÷3=20 是梨。"}, {"id": "hi-math-36", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "一个数除以 0.5，相当于把这个数怎么样？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "除以 2"}, {"id": "b", "text": "不变"}, {"id": "c", "text": "加 2"}, {"id": "d", "text": "乘 2"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "÷0.5 = ÷(1/2) = ×2。"}, {"id": "hi-math-37", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "一辆车从 A 到 B 用 4 小时，返回用 6 小时，往返平均速度比去时怎样？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "更慢"}, {"id": "b", "text": "更快"}, {"id": "c", "text": "相同"}, {"id": "d", "text": "无法判断"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "返回更慢拉低了平均速度，往返平均速度比去时慢。"}, {"id": "hi-math-38", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "把 25% 化成最简分数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "2/5"}, {"id": "b", "text": "1/4"}, {"id": "c", "text": "1/25"}, {"id": "d", "text": "25/10"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "25%=25/100=1/4。"}, {"id": "hi-math-39", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "一个三位数，百位是 2、十位是 0、个位是 5，这个数是多少？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "250"}, {"id": "b", "text": "25"}, {"id": "c", "text": "205"}, {"id": "d", "text": "502"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "百位2、十位0、个位5 → 205。"}, {"id": "hi-math-40", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "一个班 45 人，男女生人数比 5:4，男生有多少人？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "20"}, {"id": "b", "text": "24"}, {"id": "c", "text": "30"}, {"id": "d", "text": "25"}], "subject": "math", "explanation": "共 9 份，45÷9=5，男生 5 份=25。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-1", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“欲穷千里目”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "更上一层楼"}, {"id": "b", "text": "白日依山尽"}, {"id": "c", "text": "黄河入海流"}, {"id": "d", "text": "一览众山小"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "出自王之涣《登鹳雀楼》：欲穷千里目，更上一层楼。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-2", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“随风潜入夜”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "花重锦官城"}, {"id": "b", "text": "润物细无声"}, {"id": "c", "text": "好雨知时节"}, {"id": "d", "text": "当春乃发生"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "杜甫《春夜喜雨》：随风潜入夜，润物细无声。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-3", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“粉骨碎身浑不怕”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "只留清白在人间"}, {"id": "b", "text": "烈火焚烧若等闲"}, {"id": "c", "text": "要留清白在人间"}, {"id": "d", "text": "千锤万凿出深山"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "于谦《石灰吟》：粉骨碎身浑不怕，要留清白在人间。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-4", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "成语“胸有成竹”最初讲的是哪位画家？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "王羲之"}, {"id": "b", "text": "吴道子"}, {"id": "c", "text": "郑板桥"}, {"id": "d", "text": "文同（文与可）"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "说北宋文同画竹前心中已有竹的形象。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-5", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“塞翁失马”这个成语告诉我们什么道理？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "坏事有时能变成好事"}, {"id": "b", "text": "丢东西要怪自己"}, {"id": "c", "text": "马跑了追不回来"}, {"id": "d", "text": "凡事要听老人的"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "比喻坏事在一定条件下可以变成好事，福祸相依。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-6", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "下面哪一句没有语病？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "通过这次活动，使我明白了团结的重要。"}, {"id": "b", "text": "他的学习成绩有了明显的提高。"}, {"id": "c", "text": "我们要避免不再犯这样的错误。"}, {"id": "d", "text": "能否成功，关键在于努力是成功的保证。"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "A 缺主语，B 否定叠用，D 前后不一致；只有 C 通顺。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-7", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "下面哪一句有语病？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "春天来了，公园里开满了鲜花。"}, {"id": "b", "text": "同学们认真听老师讲课。"}, {"id": "c", "text": "为了防止溺水事故不再发生，学校加强了教育。"}, {"id": "d", "text": "这本书很有意思。"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“防止…不再发生”否定多余，应为“防止…发生”。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-8", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“望洋兴叹”原意是面对什么而感叹？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "太阳升起"}, {"id": "b", "text": "高山险峻"}, {"id": "c", "text": "战争失败"}, {"id": "d", "text": "大海的辽阔"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "出自《庄子》，河伯见大海无边而叹，比喻力量不够而无可奈何。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-9", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“相得益彰”是什么意思？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "互相配合，更显出各自的长处"}, {"id": "b", "text": "互相争夺好处"}, {"id": "c", "text": "彼此不和"}, {"id": "d", "text": "得到很多奖赏"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "指两者互相配合衬托，使好处更突出。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-10", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“鹤立鸡群”用来形容什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "一个人很孤单"}, {"id": "b", "text": "一个人的才能或仪表在众人中很突出"}, {"id": "c", "text": "动物打架"}, {"id": "d", "text": "人多很热闹"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "比喻一个人的才能或外表在一群人中显得特别突出。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-11", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“络绎不绝”常用来形容什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "声音很大"}, {"id": "b", "text": "颜色很多"}, {"id": "c", "text": "人马来往，连续不断"}, {"id": "d", "text": "天气很好"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "形容行人车马来来往往，连续不断。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-12", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“朝”是多音字。“朝霞”的“朝”读什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "cháo"}, {"id": "b", "text": "zhào"}, {"id": "c", "text": "chāo"}, {"id": "d", "text": "zhāo"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“朝霞、朝阳”指早晨，读 zhāo；“朝代、朝向”读 cháo。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-13", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“扁”是多音字。“扁舟”的“扁”读什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "piān"}, {"id": "b", "text": "biǎn"}, {"id": "c", "text": "piàn"}, {"id": "d", "text": "biān"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“扁舟”指小船，读 piān；“扁平、扁担”读 biǎn。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-14", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“宁”是多音字。“宁可”的“宁”读什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "níng"}, {"id": "b", "text": "nìng"}, {"id": "c", "text": "nǐng"}, {"id": "d", "text": "líng"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“宁可、宁愿”读 nìng；“安宁、宁静”读 níng。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-15", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "下面哪个词没有错别字？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "迫不急待"}, {"id": "b", "text": "再接再励"}, {"id": "c", "text": "震耳欲聋"}, {"id": "d", "text": "走头无路"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "正确写法：迫不及待、再接再厉、走投无路；只有“震耳欲聋”对。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-16", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "下面哪个词语全部没有错别字？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "默默无蚊、川流不息"}, {"id": "b", "text": "兴高彩烈、和霭可亲"}, {"id": "c", "text": "专心至志、滥竽充数"}, {"id": "d", "text": "一如既往、变本加厉"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "B 蚊→闻，C 彩→采、霭→蔼，D 至→致；只有 A 全对。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-17", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“他的写作水平大大改进了。”这句话用词不当，应把哪个词换掉？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "把“改进”换成“提高”"}, {"id": "b", "text": "把“水平”换成“成绩”"}, {"id": "c", "text": "把“大大”换成“非常”"}, {"id": "d", "text": "不用改"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“水平”应搭配“提高”，不说“改进水平”。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-18", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "下面哪句话用了比喻的修辞手法？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "小河哗啦啦地唱着歌。"}, {"id": "b", "text": "月亮像一只弯弯的小船。"}, {"id": "c", "text": "难道我们不应该努力吗？"}, {"id": "d", "text": "风啊，请你慢些走。"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "把月亮比作小船是比喻；A 拟人，C 反问，D 拟人/呼告。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-19", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "下面哪句话用了夸张的修辞手法？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "柳树姑娘梳着长发"}, {"id": "b", "text": "这道题真难啊"}, {"id": "c", "text": "飞流直下三千尺"}, {"id": "d", "text": "太阳从东边升起"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "瀑布“三千尺”是夸张，极言其高。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-20", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“甘”在“甘拜下风”里是什么意思？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "甜的"}, {"id": "b", "text": "甘肃"}, {"id": "c", "text": "干脆"}, {"id": "d", "text": "心甘情愿"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“甘拜下风”指真心佩服、自愿认输，“甘”是甘心、情愿。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-21", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“走马观花”用来比喻什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "粗略地观察，不深入"}, {"id": "b", "text": "骑马很快乐"}, {"id": "c", "text": "看花展"}, {"id": "d", "text": "春游踏青"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "比喻粗略地观察事物，了解不深入。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-22", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "下面哪组词是反义词？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "美丽——漂亮"}, {"id": "b", "text": "崭新——陈旧"}, {"id": "c", "text": "聪明——伶俐"}, {"id": "d", "text": "高兴——快乐"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "崭新与陈旧意思相反；其余三组都是近义词。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-23", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“雪中送炭”比喻什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "冬天烧炭取暖"}, {"id": "b", "text": "送礼物"}, {"id": "c", "text": "在别人最需要时给予帮助"}, {"id": "d", "text": "画蛇添足"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "比喻在别人困难急需的时候给予帮助。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-24", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“锦上添花”和“雪中送炭”比，区别是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "意思完全一样"}, {"id": "b", "text": "都指帮倒忙"}, {"id": "c", "text": "都和天气有关"}, {"id": "d", "text": "锦上添花是好上加好，雪中送炭是危难相助"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "锦上添花是好上加好；雪中送炭是在困难时帮人，更可贵。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-25", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“竹篮打水”的歇后语后半句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "一场空"}, {"id": "b", "text": "满载而归"}, {"id": "c", "text": "事半功倍"}, {"id": "d", "text": "水到渠成"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“竹篮打水——一场空”，比喻白费力气。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-26", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“八仙过海”的歇后语后半句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "人多力量大"}, {"id": "b", "text": "各显神通"}, {"id": "c", "text": "一帆风顺"}, {"id": "d", "text": "团结一心"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“八仙过海——各显神通”，比喻各自施展本领。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-27", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“春蚕到死丝方尽”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "夜吟应觉月光寒"}, {"id": "b", "text": "相见时难别亦难"}, {"id": "c", "text": "蜡炬成灰泪始干"}, {"id": "d", "text": "东风无力百花残"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "李商隐《无题》：春蚕到死丝方尽，蜡炬成灰泪始干。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-28", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“千磨万击还坚劲”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "咬定青山不放松"}, {"id": "b", "text": "立根原在破岩中"}, {"id": "c", "text": "一枝一叶总关情"}, {"id": "d", "text": "任尔东西南北风"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "郑燮《竹石》：千磨万击还坚劲，任尔东西南北风。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-29", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“黑发不知勤学早”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "白首方悔读书迟"}, {"id": "b", "text": "少壮不努力"}, {"id": "c", "text": "老大徒伤悲"}, {"id": "d", "text": "一寸光阴一寸金"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "颜真卿《劝学》：黑发不知勤学早，白首方悔读书迟。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-30", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“持之以恒”是什么意思？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "半途而废"}, {"id": "b", "text": "长久地坚持下去"}, {"id": "c", "text": "随时改变主意"}, {"id": "d", "text": "拿着东西"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "指有恒心地长久坚持下去。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-31", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "阅读：“小溪从山间流出，一路欢唱着奔向远方。”这句话主要用了什么手法？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "排比"}, {"id": "b", "text": "设问"}, {"id": "c", "text": "拟人"}, {"id": "d", "text": "对偶"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“欢唱”把小溪当人写，是拟人。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-32", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“画龙点睛”比喻什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "多此一举"}, {"id": "b", "text": "画画很难"}, {"id": "c", "text": "弄虚作假"}, {"id": "d", "text": "在关键处加上精彩的一笔，使内容更生动"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "比喻在关键地方点明要旨，使内容更精彩传神。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-33", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“班门弄斧”讽刺的是哪种人？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "在行家面前卖弄本领的人"}, {"id": "b", "text": "不会用斧头的人"}, {"id": "c", "text": "木匠"}, {"id": "d", "text": "谦虚的人"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "在鲁班门前舞弄斧头，比喻在行家面前卖弄。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-34", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "下面哪个句子是反问句？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "今天天气真好。"}, {"id": "b", "text": "这件事难道不值得我们深思吗？"}, {"id": "c", "text": "你吃饭了吗？"}, {"id": "d", "text": "请把窗户关上。"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "反问句用疑问的形式表达肯定的意思，A 是反问。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-35", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "把“他听了这个消息很高兴。”改成感叹句，下面哪个对？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "他听了这个消息高兴吗？"}, {"id": "b", "text": "他听了这个消息。"}, {"id": "c", "text": "他听了这个消息多高兴啊！"}, {"id": "d", "text": "他听了这个消息不高兴。"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "感叹句带“多…啊”等并用感叹号，表达强烈感情。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-36", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“鞠躬尽瘁”常和哪个词连用，形容人为事业拼尽全力？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "安然无恙"}, {"id": "b", "text": "春暖花开"}, {"id": "c", "text": "一帆风顺"}, {"id": "d", "text": "死而后已"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“鞠躬尽瘁，死而后已”出自诸葛亮《后出师表》。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-37", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“小荷才露尖尖角”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "早有蜻蜓立上头"}, {"id": "b", "text": "映日荷花别样红"}, {"id": "c", "text": "接天莲叶无穷碧"}, {"id": "d", "text": "泉眼无声惜细流"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "杨万里《小池》：小荷才露尖尖角，早有蜻蜓立上头。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-38", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“一寸光阴一寸金”的下一句是什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "少壮不努力"}, {"id": "b", "text": "寸金难买寸光阴"}, {"id": "c", "text": "老大徒伤悲"}, {"id": "d", "text": "及时当勉励"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "“一寸光阴一寸金，寸金难买寸光阴”，劝人珍惜时间。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-39", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“temperature 高”这种中英混说在正式作文里属于什么问题？(选最准确的)", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "语序错误"}, {"id": "b", "text": "标点错误"}, {"id": "c", "text": "用词夹杂、不规范"}, {"id": "d", "text": "没有问题"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "正式写作应使用规范的汉语，不宜中英文夹杂。"}, {"id": "hi-chinese-40", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“水滴石穿”和下面哪个成语意思最接近？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "半途而废"}, {"id": "b", "text": "一蹴而就"}, {"id": "c", "text": "画蛇添足"}, {"id": "d", "text": "锲而不舍"}], "subject": "chinese", "explanation": "都强调坚持不懈才能成功。"}, {"id": "hi-english-1", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“I ___ my homework yesterday.” 填哪个（过去时）？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "did"}, {"id": "b", "text": "do"}, {"id": "c", "text": "doing"}, {"id": "d", "text": "does"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "yesterday 表示过去，用过去式 did。"}, {"id": "hi-english-2", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“She is good ___ singing.” 填哪个介词？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "in"}, {"id": "b", "text": "at"}, {"id": "c", "text": "for"}, {"id": "d", "text": "of"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "固定搭配 be good at 表示“擅长”。"}, {"id": "hi-english-3", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“There are many ___ in the box.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "box"}, {"id": "b", "text": "boxs"}, {"id": "c", "text": "boxes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "boxies"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "以 x 结尾的名词复数加 es：box→boxes。"}, {"id": "hi-english-4", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“He ___ TV when I came in.” 填哪个（进行时）？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "watched"}, {"id": "b", "text": "watches"}, {"id": "c", "text": "is watching"}, {"id": "d", "text": "was watching"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "过去某时正在做，用过去进行时 was watching。"}, {"id": "hi-english-5", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“This bag is ___ than that one.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "heavier"}, {"id": "b", "text": "heavy"}, {"id": "c", "text": "heaviest"}, {"id": "d", "text": "more heavy"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "than 前用比较级，heavy→heavier。"}, {"id": "hi-english-6", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“Tom is the ___ student in his class.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "tall"}, {"id": "b", "text": "tallest"}, {"id": "c", "text": "taller"}, {"id": "d", "text": "most tall"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "the + 最高级，tall→tallest。"}, {"id": "hi-english-7", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“I have two ___.” 填哪个（脚的复数）？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "foots"}, {"id": "b", "text": "feets"}, {"id": "c", "text": "feet"}, {"id": "d", "text": "foot"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "foot 的复数是不规则的 feet。"}, {"id": "hi-english-8", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“___ you ever ___ to Beijing?” 现在完成时填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "Did / go"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Are / go"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Do / went"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Have / been"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "ever 常用现在完成时：Have you ever been…？"}, {"id": "hi-english-9", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“My birthday is ___ October.” 填哪个介词？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "in"}, {"id": "b", "text": "on"}, {"id": "c", "text": "at"}, {"id": "d", "text": "to"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "月份前用 in：in October。"}, {"id": "hi-english-10", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“See you ___ Monday morning.” 填哪个介词？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "in"}, {"id": "b", "text": "on"}, {"id": "c", "text": "at"}, {"id": "d", "text": "of"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "具体某天（含早中晚）用 on：on Monday morning。"}, {"id": "hi-english-11", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“There ___ some milk in the cup.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "are"}, {"id": "b", "text": "have"}, {"id": "c", "text": "is"}, {"id": "d", "text": "has"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "milk 不可数，用 is。"}, {"id": "hi-english-12", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“Would you like ___ tea?” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "any"}, {"id": "b", "text": "a"}, {"id": "c", "text": "many"}, {"id": "d", "text": "some"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "表示委婉邀请/请求时用 some。"}, {"id": "hi-english-13", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“He runs ___ than me.” 填哪个（副词比较级）？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "faster"}, {"id": "b", "text": "fast"}, {"id": "c", "text": "fastest"}, {"id": "d", "text": "more fast"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "修饰动词 runs 用副词比较级 faster。"}, {"id": "hi-english-14", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "“The book ___ by many people.” 填哪个（被动）？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "reads"}, {"id": "b", "text": "is read"}, {"id": "c", "text": "reading"}, {"id": "d", "text": "read"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "书“被”读，用被动语态 is read。"}, {"id": "hi-english-15", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“Listen! Someone ___ at the door.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "knocks"}, {"id": "b", "text": "knocked"}, {"id": "c", "text": "is knocking"}, {"id": "d", "text": "knock"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "Listen! 提示此刻正在发生，用现在进行时。"}, {"id": "hi-english-16", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“I will call you ___ I arrive