nd": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“If it ___ tomorrow, we will stay home.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "will rain"}, {"id": "b", "text": "rained"}, {"id": "c", "text": "rains"}, {"id": "d", "text": "raining"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "if 引导的条件句，主将从现，从句用一般现在时 rains。"}, {"id": "hi-english-24", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“The girl ___ is reading is my sister.” 填哪个（定语从句）？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "which"}, {"id": "b", "text": "what"}, {"id": "c", "text": "whose"}, {"id": "d", "text": "who"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "先行词是人 girl，用 who。"}, {"id": "hi-english-25", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“There aren't ___ apples in the fridge.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "any"}, {"id": "b", "text": "some"}, {"id": "c", "text": "much"}, {"id": "d", "text": "a"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "否定句中用 any。"}, {"id": "hi-english-26", "band": "high", "answer": "b", "prompt": "阅读：“Lily likes apples, but she doesn't like bananas.” Lily 喜欢什么？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "bananas"}, {"id": "b", "text": "apples"}, {"id": "c", "text": "两个都喜欢"}, {"id": "d", "text": "两个都不喜欢"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "likes apples 表示喜欢苹果，but 后说不喜欢香蕉。"}, {"id": "hi-english-27", "band": "high", "answer": "c", "prompt": "“He is interested ___ science.” 填哪个介词？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "on"}, {"id": "b", "text": "at"}, {"id": "c", "text": "in"}, {"id": "d", "text": "with"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "固定搭配 be interested in。"}, {"id": "hi-english-28", "band": "high", "answer": "d", "prompt": "“My mother ___ cooking now.” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "are"}, {"id": "b", "text": "am"}, {"id": "c", "text": "be"}, {"id": "d", "text": "is"}], "subject": "english", "explanation": "主语 mother 是第三人称单数，现在进行用 is。"}, {"id": "hi-english-29", "band": "high", "answer": "a", "prompt": "“Could you ___ me how to get there?” 填哪个？", "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "tell"}, {"id": "b", "text": 